                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8f9d1aa9-209f-32c1-b8ce-2853881ba759",
                        "entry_id": "466cab3c-d36d-3cb2-aa19-37dde0ae37b1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "divorcée"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "feminine",
                            "inanimate"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c8aa4706-c47c-4aee-8ec0-64f56f0b480f",
                                "sense_id": "8f9d1aa9-209f-32c1-b8ce-2853881ba759",
                                "text": "На у́лице не даду́т прохо́да языка́тые кержа́чки, что поедо́м едя́т дереве́нских «бро́шенок» и «разведёнок», и те хо́дят к ре́чке полоска́ть бельё ноча́ми.",
                                "translation": "Sharp-tongued Old Believer women who harass \"fatherless children\" and \"divorcées\" in the village will block their way on the street, so they go to the river to do the laundry at night.",
                                "english": "Sharp-tongued Old Believer women who harass \"fatherless children\" and \"divorcées\" in the village will block their way on the street, so they go to the river to do the laundry at night."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
